title Motor Claim Portal

component motor-claims-webapp as "Motor Claims Portal" web-application
component motor-claims-api as "Motor Claims API" service
component claims-db as "Claims Database" database

east thunder-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south email-service as "Email Service" service

north -> motor-claims-webapp

motor-claims-webapp -> motor-claims-api
motor-claims-webapp -> thunder-auth
motor-claims-api -> thunder-auth
motor-claims-api -> claims-db
motor-claims-api -> email-service
